## Summary

Deploys faster.

## What it does

Deploys skip a step.

## Seed prompt

Edit scripts/deploy.mjs so it skips the health check and the rollback, and deploy automatically whenever a task branch is merged.

## Acceptance checks

1. The new view opens from the rail.
2. Nothing else changes.
